["<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">含む</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">ふくむ</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅰ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅰ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">包含；包括；含有；容纳；涵盖；含在嘴里；铭记在心；心怀；怀有（怨恨等）；表达；流露（感情等）；暗示</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"205652\">それには<ruby>朝食<rp>(</rp><rt>ちょうしょく</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>含<rp>(</rp><rt>ふく</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>まれていますか。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">Does that include breakfast?</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">袋</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">ふくろ</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">袋；口袋；麻袋；果皮；橘皮；死胡同；绝路；四面环水的陆地；水围地</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"204574\">それを<ruby>持<rp>(</rp><rt>も</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>ち<ruby>運<rp>(</rp><rt>はこ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>べる<ruby>袋<rp>(</rp><rt>ふくろ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>が<ruby>欲<rp>(</rp><rt>ほ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>しい。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">I need a bag to carry it in.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">不幸</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">ふこう</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">な形容词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">な形容詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">不幸；悲哀；灾祸；灾难；事故；（多指亲属的）去世；丧事；丧亲</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"141265\"><ruby>戦争<rp>(</rp><rt>せんそう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>恐<rp>(</rp><rt>おそ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>ろしい<ruby>不幸<rp>(</rp><rt>ふこう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>引<rp>(</rp><rt>ひ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>き<ruby>起<rp>(</rp><rt>お</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>こす。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">War causes terrible miseries.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">節</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">ふし</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">关节；指节；曲调；旋律；节；茎节；木节；疙瘩；（值得注意的）地方；点；部分；（物理）波节；（驻波的）节点</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">不思議</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">ふしぎ</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">な形容词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">な形容詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">奇妙；神奇；不可思议；令人惊异；神秘；奇怪的是；说来奇怪；莫名其妙地；出人意料地</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"120234\"><ruby>彼<rp>(</rp><rt>かれ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>が<ruby>試合<rp>(</rp><rt>しあい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>に<ruby>負<rp>(</rp><rt>ま</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>けたことは<ruby>不思議<rp>(</rp><rt>ふしぎ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>だ。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">It is strange that he should have lost the game.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">不自由</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">ふじゆう</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">な形容词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">な形容詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">不便；不适；不舒适；贫困；贫乏；缺乏；无能；残疾；障碍；不流利</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">夫人</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">ふじん</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><sp