pan><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅰ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">防御；抵御；防护；防止；预防；避免</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"187768\"><ruby>何<rp>(</rp><rt>なん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>としても<ruby>戦争<rp>(</rp><rt>せんそう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>防<rp>(</rp><rt>ふせ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>がねばならない。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">We must prevent war at any cost.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">不足</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">ふそく</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">な形容词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">な形容詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">不足；缺乏；短缺；匮乏；赤字；不满；不满意；怨言</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"211286\">その<ruby>計画<rp>(</rp><rt>けいかく</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>には<ruby>資金<rp>(</rp><rt>しきん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>が<ruby>不足<rp>(</rp><rt>ふそく</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>していた。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">Money for the plan was lacking.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">双子</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">ふたご</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">双胞胎；孪生儿</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"208361\">その<ruby>双子<rp>(</rp><rt>ふたご</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>全<rp>(</rp><rt>まった</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>くよく<ruby>似<rp>(</rp><rt>に</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>ている。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">The twins are very much alike.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">再び</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">ふたたび</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">副词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">副詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">再次；重新；又一次</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"212546\">そのようなことが<ruby>再<rp>(</rp><rt>ふたた</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>び<ruby>起<rp>(</rp><rt>お</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>こりうるだろうか。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">Can such a thing happen again?</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">普段</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">ふだん</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/kanji/\">N3</a><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../../n2/kanji/\">N2</a><span class=\"v-m\">平时</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span class=\"lx-src\"><span class=\"t-zh\">汉字 </span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">漢字 </span><a href=\"../../n2/kanji/\" lang=\"ja\">普</a></span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">縁</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">ふち</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">边缘；边；边框</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"96758\"><ruby>彼<rp>(</rp><rt>かれ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>らは<ruby>水瓶<rp>(</rp><rt>みずがめ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>縁<rp>(</rp><rt>ふち</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>まで<ruby>一杯<rp>(</rp><rt>いっぱい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>にした。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">They filled the jug to the brim.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">筆</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">ふで</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">笔；毛笔；画笔；用毛笔书写；用毛笔作画；书法；笔墨（书画作品）；写作；书面文字；宗地；地块</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"169013\"><ruby>仕上<rp>(</rp><rt>しあ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>げの<ruby>筆<rp>(</rp><rt>ふで</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>少<rp>(</rp><rt>すこ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>し<ruby>加<rp>(</rp><rt>くわ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>える。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">I add a few finishing touches.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">ふと</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">副词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">副詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">突然；偶然；无意中；意外地</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"216852\">サイフがないのにふと<ruby>気<rp>(</rp><rt>き</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>がついた。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">He suddenly noticed his wallet was missing.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">船</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">ふね</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">船；舟；船舶；水上飞机；槽；桶；盆；池；船形容器个数的量词</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"96675\"><ruby>彼<rp>(</rp><rt>かれ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>らは<ruby>船<rp>(</rp><rt>ふね</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>岸<rp>(</rp><rt>きし</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>に<ruby>引<rp>(</rp><rt>ひ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>き<ruby>上<rp>(</rp><rt>あ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>げた。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">They drew their boat on the beach.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">不平</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">ふへい</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">な形容词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">な形容詞</span></